        // - depositsCount must never decrease (fallback increments it only), and owner-only withdraws do not change depositsCount.
        // - If the call reverted, balances and depositsCount must be unchanged.
        // - If the call succeeded, depositsCount must remain the same, and c's balance must be <= beforeBalanceC.
        assert(
